# Strict allowlist: EVERYTHING is ignored unless it is re-included below.
# Adding a new kind of file to this repository therefore requires a deliberate edit here.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!PRIVACY.md
!requirements.txt

!e3_paper/
!e3_paper/*.py

!tests/
!tests/test_*.py

!docs/
!docs/CODEBOOK.md
!docs/prototype_sentences.md
!docs/rubric_reappraisal_v1.txt

!outputs/
!outputs/e3/
!outputs/e3/*_SAFE.csv
!outputs/e3/*_SAFE.json
!outputs/e3/*_SAFE.png

# Never commit these, even if a pattern above would match them.
*PRIVATE*
*private*
**/synth/
**/output/
**/intermediate_PRIVATE/
**/llm_cache/
**/logs/
**/external/
**/sota_models/
**/hf_cache/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.b64
*.log
*.jsonl
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.parquet
*.xlsx
*.sav
*.qsf
.env
*.key
*.pem
